<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22980" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn-effĭcax</span></b> ,
			ācis, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>ineffectual</i>, <i>inefficient</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox inefficax verborum,</span>”
				<i>unproductive of</i>, <i>unable to produce</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 1, 3</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ratio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 1, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Ben. 4, 4</span></i>
			.— <i>Comp.</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 34,
				11, 25, § 109</span></i>: parentes inefficacissimi, i. e.
				<i>very weak</i>, Inscr. ap. Grut. 415,
				10.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭneffĭcācĭter</span></b> ,
				<i>ineffectually</i>, <i>in
			vain</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 49, 8, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cod.
				Just. 6, 35, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Symm. Ep.
				6, 53</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
